#: src/components/animations-editor-modal.js:126
#| msgid "%s animation imported successfully!"
msgid "Animation imported successfully!"
msgstr "Animation erfolgreich importiert!"

#: build/tzm-block-scroll-animations.js:1 src/components/guide-modal.js:101
msgid ""
"Apply <strong>Easing curves</strong> (<icon/>) other than linear to fine-"
"tune how the animation progresses through it's timeline."
msgstr ""
"Wenden Sie nicht-lineare <strong>Easing-Kurven</strong> (<icon/>) an, um den "
"Animationsverlauf entlang der Timeline feiner zu steuern."

#: build/tzm-block-scroll-animations.js:1 src/components/guide-modal.js:42
msgid ""
"Block Scroll Animations allows you to add scroll-driven animations to your "
"blocks easily. Animate properties such as position, rotation, size, opacity, "
"and more."
msgstr ""
"Mit Block Scroll Animations können Sie Ihren Blöcken ganz einfach "
"scrollbasierte Animationen hinzufügen. Animieren Sie Eigenschaften wie "
"Position, Drehung, Größe, Deckkraft und mehr."

#: build/tzm-block-scroll-animations.js:1 src/components/guide-modal.js:32
msgid "Block Scroll Animations Guide"
msgstr "Block Scroll Animations-Anleitung"

